# "Whenever YOU sacrifice a permanent": Innocent Blood makes each player sacrifice a creature. Bot1 sacrifices its Memnite (keeping the
# Egotist) and Bot2 its Ornithopter: only Bot1's sacrifice drains, once (Bot2 19, Bot1 21), and Bot2's own sacrifice gives nothing
# (it does not lose-and-gain a second time).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Popular Egotist
Memnite
Innocent Blood
Swamp
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Popular Egotist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Innocent Blood.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield.Popular Egotist.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Innocent Blood; Memnite
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Stack.Count = 0
